<p>mujeh matloob hoga jaamm lena jab bhi kousar ka<br />
salaam aisa padhoonga dil bhar aaega payambar ka</p>

<p>Zameene karbala kya poochna tere muqaddar ka<br />
hai tujh me aaj tak mehfooz sarmaaya payambar ka</p>

<p>kamar qam kyu'n na ho dil gham se toote kyu'n na sarwar ka<br />
alambardaar aaqir bhai tha baazu baraabar ka</p>

<p>labe darya alambardaarbhi kaam aa gaya aaaqir<br />
bas ab allah hafiz hazrate zainab ki chaadar ka</p>

<p>teri gheerat ko aaqir kya hua kuch toone soncha bhi<br />
bhari mehfil me kaisa tazkera zainab ki chaadar ka</p>

<p>ghadi bhar bhi rabaab aaraam se sone nahi paati<br />
wo jab karwat badalti hai qayaal aata hai asghar ka</p>

<p>saeed zaar par jab bhi koi uftaad aati hai<br />
bas ek aadat si hai wo naam le leta hai hyder ka</p>